normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We have received your purchase request for the BD Growth Suite&#39;s <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: pre-wrap; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">%%%Service_name%%%</span> service.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>Your purchase order is processed.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"6\" style=\"font-weight: bold; background: #e3e3e3;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Service/Tools:</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%%%Service_name%%%</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Service Description:</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%%%Service_desc%%%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><u>If there are available credits in your BD Growth Suite account</u>, the same will be adjusted. If the credits in your account are sufficient, there won&#39;t be any dues to pay. At the earliest, one of the experts will get assigned to execute your work order or get in touch with you.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><u>If there is a shortage of credits</u>, one of our account managers will send you an invoice for the balance payment. Upon the payment of the balance invoice, one of the experts will get assigned to execute your work order&nbsp;or get in touch with you.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">By purchasing the BD Growth Suite&#39;s <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: pre-wrap; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">%%%Service_name%%%</span> service, you just mobilized the largest in-house Brilliant Directories development team for your project. We assure you quality work and timely completion along with premier customer assistance.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We look forward to a long-lasting association.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To check the Wallet balance and list of transactions - <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/account/wallet\"><strong>click here.</strong></a></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team.</span></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2023-03-11 10:59:18', 1),
(22, 'payment-email', '', 'Your payment is updated in your BDGrowthSuite Wallet', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hello <strong style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: pre-wrap; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">%First_name%,</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have added your Invoice payment details to your BD Growth Suite Account.</span></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"6\" style=\"font-weight: bold; background: #e3e3e3;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Invoice ID:&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%%%invoice_id%%%</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">You paid:</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">$%%%balance%%%</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px