-space:pre-wrap;\">We strive to bring only the best Brilliant Directories development and maintenance services to you. And we work hard to make our customer services unparalleled in the market.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We hope to continue our collaboration with you for an eternity.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team.</span></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2023-03-11 10:59:08', 1),
(25, 'email-maintenance-on-checkoutsignup', '', 'Thank You for Choosing our BD Maintenance Services', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thank You for Choosing BD Growth Suite</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hello&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">%First_name%</span>, &nbsp;</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have received your request for maintaining your Brilliant Directories Website. We will mobilize our expert team soon and get in touch with you with the details and further steps.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are excited to have you onboard BD Growth Suite. Let&rsquo;s work together to transform your website into a successful business.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Maintenance Plan: <span style=\'color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Quicksand, \"open sans\", arial, \"san serif\"; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: nowrap; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\'>%invoice_product_name%</span></strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team.</span></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2021-12-07 18:05:51', 1),
(26, 'registration-admin', '', 'Admin - Thank you for signing up with BD Growth Suite.', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">To ADMIN:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Copy of email that client received:<br><br><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hello&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size: 16px;\"><strong>%First_name%</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thank you for signing up with BD Growth Suite. You just partnered with the largest in-house Brilliant Directories developer team to work on your business directory/membership website.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We offer nothing but excellence and utmost professionalism. Hop over to our website (</span><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#0563c1;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">https://bdgrowthsuite.com/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">) and explore the extensive range of services we have for you. And do not forget to claim and use your FREE $100 credit that we will shortly place in your <strong><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/account/wallet\" style=\"display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">BD Wallet</a>.</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are excited to have you onboard with us.</span></strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; padding: 15px 0px; font-family: arial; color: #0d83dd;\">Your Log In Details</span>:</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"6\" style=\"font-weight: bold; background: rgb(227, 227, 227); width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Username:</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%user_email%</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span id=\"isPasted\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">Password</span>:&nbsp;</td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span id=\"isPasted\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">(Entered During Signup)</span><br></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span id=\"isPasted\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 65, 65); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">Origin Page</span>:</span></td><td style=\"background: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%url_origin%<br></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>You can <a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/login/retrieval\" style=\"display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">click here</a> to reset your password in case you forgot your password.</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team.</span></strong></p><p><br></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2025-12-15 09:38:34', 1),
(27, 'thank-you-for-submitting-design-idea', '', 'Thank you for submitting your Design Idea with BD Growth Suite.', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hello %First_name%,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Thank you for submitting an idea to BDGrowthSuite&#39;s campaign: &#39;Building 100 Designs for BD&quot;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We pick and develop one or two top-voted design ideas for the month.&nbsp;</span><br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>If your design is picked, &nbsp;you and the first two upvoters will get it for a 100% discount</strong> (without any obligation to purchase anything else.)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All other BD site owners who upvote on a winning idea get a 50% discount on already reasonably priced designs.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>This is the link to your design idea:</strong>&nbsp;</span><a data-fr-linked=\"true\" href=\"\" id=\"isPasted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">%groupfilename%</span></a>,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>which you posted a moment ago</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>.</strong></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>Share your idea to get votes from other BD site owners by posting it on some of the below social media groups where BD site owners hang out:</strong></span><strong><br></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>1/ Brilliant Directories &ndash; Official Facebook</strong> <strong>Group:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/\"><br></a><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>2/ Grow with BusinessLabs - your Directories and Membership sites:</strong>&nbsp;</span> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/grow.with.businesslabs/\" id=\"isPasted\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/grow.with.businesslabs/</span></a><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Just copy the URL of your posted idea and share it with other BD site owners; it&#39;s that simple.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><em>Please note: that voting will be available for only 15 days. However, everyone can make comments anytime on your idea post.</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">P.S.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you were not a BD Growth Suite customer and registered with BD Growth Suite while submitting your design idea, you should have received one more email with the subject line &quot;Thank you for signing up with BD Growth Suite-Ideas&quot; to thank you for initiating this relationship and with a free gift worth $100.</span><br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team</span></strong></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2023-04-13 13:12:10', 1),
(28, 'admin-thank-you-for-submitting-design-idea', '', 'Admin - Thank you for submitting your Design Idea with BD Growth Suite', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">TO ADMIN:<br>Copy of email that the client received:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hello %First_name%,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Thank you for submitting an idea to BDGrowthSuite&#39;s campaign: &#39;Building 100 Designs for BD&quot;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We pick and develop one or two top-voted design ideas for the month.&nbsp;</span><br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>If your design is picked, &nbsp;you and the first two upvoters will get it for a 100% discount</strong> (without any obligation to purchase anything else.)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All other BD site owners who upvote on a winning idea get a 50% discount on already reasonably priced designs.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>This is the link to your design idea:</strong></span><a data-fr-linked=\"true\" href=\"\" id=\"isPasted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">%groupfilename%</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>which you posted a moment ago</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>.</strong></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>Share your idea to get votes from other BD site owners by posting it on some of the below social media groups where BD site owners hang out:</strong></span><strong><br></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>1/ Brilliant Directories &ndash; Official Facebook&nbsp;</strong><strong>Group:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;  background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/</span></a><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>2/ Grow with BusinessLabs - your Directories and Membership sites:&nbsp;</strong><strong>Group:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/BrilliantDirectories/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;  background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/grow.with.businesslabs/</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Just copy the URL of your posted idea and share it with other BD site owners; it&#39;s that simple.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><em>Please note: that voting will be available for only 15 days. However, everyone can make comments anytime on your idea post.</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">P.S.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you were not a BD Growth Suite customer and registered with BD Growth Suite while submitting your design idea, you should have received one more email with the subject line &quot;Thank you for signing up with BD Growth Suite-Ideas&quot; to thank you for initiating this relationship and with a free gift worth $100.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Regards,</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The BD Growth Suite Team</span></strong></p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2023-04-13 13:11:23', 1),
