(48, 'cyberweek2025-email2', '3', 'What BD Site Owners Picked This Cyber Week', '<!-- Subject: What BD Site Owners Picked This Cyber Week --><p><title>What BD Site Owners Picked This Cyber Week</title></p><!-- Preheader (hidden) --><div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#ffffff;\">At upto 75% Off: The most-picked BD themes, tools, plus a $250 credit on custom work for small tasks this Cyber Week.</div><!-- Main wrapper --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 10px;\"><!-- Content card --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 4px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><!-- Title --><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 24px; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">What BD Site Owners Picked This Cyber Week</td></tr><!-- Greeting --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; color:#333333;\">Hi %%%First_name%%%,</td></tr><!-- Intro --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">We’re halfway through Cyber Week, and here’s what Brilliant Directories site owners are choosing the most so far — in case it helps you decide quickly and make the most of the offers.</td></tr><!-- Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 1: Themes --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">1) Most-Picked Themes (Up to 50% Off + Extra 25% Off)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Across all four BD Growth Suite themes, these are getting the most attention:<br><br>•&nbsp;<strong>DesignSpace</strong> — versatile, modern, ideal for premium service or creative niches<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Real Estate Theme</strong> — strong listing layout and clean agent profiles<br>•&nbsp;<strong>Caringly</strong> — well-suited for services, wellness, coaches and consultants<br>•&nbsp;<strong>DineHub</strong> — focused on restaurants and hospitality directories<br>Yes, all the four themes what our clients loved.<br><br>The Cyber Week theme pricing still combines up to <strong>50% off</strong> with an <strong>extra 25% off</strong>, limited to <strong><s>10</s> 5 clients or <s>50</s> 36 pages</strong>, whichever comes first.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/themes\" style=\"color: rgb(26, 115, 232); text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">Browse themes</a></td></tr><!-- Small Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 2: Tools --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">2) Most-Picked Tools (Flat 50% Off on All 50+ Tools)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">BD site owners are mostly choosing tools that improve conversion, UX and content:<br><br>•&nbsp;<strong>“You May Also Like” – Related Posts for Blogs</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Enhanced Member Card Elements in Search Results</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Custom Tabs on Member Profiles</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Lead Gen on Search Results Page</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Add Google Reviews to Member Profiles</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Table of Contents / Index for Articles</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Member Profile Tabs Edits</strong><br>•&nbsp;<strong>Floating Social Media Icons</strong><br><br>All tools are currently at a straight <strong>50% off</strong>, so it’s a good time to pick up anything you know you’ll eventually need. (10 Clients can avail more)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:13px;\"><a href=\"https://bdgrowthsuite.com/tools\" style=\"color: rgb(26, 115, 232); text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">View all tools</a></td></tr><!-- Larger Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 3: $250 OFF Custom Work --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">3) $250 Credit on Custom Work (No Minimum)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you’ve been holding off on a small fix or a one-off improvement, this week is a good time to clear it.<br><br>For Cyber Week, we’re offering a <strong>$250 credit on custom work</strong>, with no minimum project size. In practical terms, that means many tasks that fit into roughly&nbsp;<strong>1–8 hours of focused work</strong> could be covered entirely by this credit.<br><br>Examples of tasks that usually fit into this range:<br>• A small custom layout or section<br>• One extra widget or CTA block<br>• A tweak to your member profile or search results<br>• A small integration, display adjustment or logic fix<br>• Cleaning up or optimizing an existing BD page or flow<br><br>Just reply with a short description of what you’d like done. We’ll confirm if it fits within the $250 credit and then schedule it.</td></tr><!-- Divider before closing --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Closing / CTA --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you’d like a quick recommendation based on your niche or what you’re planning to build with Brilliant Directories, just reply to this email — happy to guide.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 24px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Warm regards,<br>BusinessLabs / BD Growth Suite</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Footer --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:11px; color:#777777; line-height:1.5; padding:10px; text-align:center;\">BusinessLabs<br>Brilliant Directories Unit<br>507, Ashoka Bhoopal Chambers<br>Hyderabad, Telangana, India — 500003<br></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>', '20251203083152', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 16, 1, '', '2025-12-04 12:57:47', 1),
