ools\" style=\"color: rgb(26, 115, 232); text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">Browse tools</a></td></tr><!-- Larger Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 3: $250 OFF Custom Work --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">3) $250 Credit on Custom Work — Last Chance</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you’ve been considering a small fix or improvement, this is the last chance to use the credit.<br><br>We’ve been offering a <strong>$250 credit on custom work</strong>. Many tasks that fit into roughly&nbsp;<strong>1–8 hours of focused work</strong> can effectively be covered by this.<br><br>Original limit:<br><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through; color:#888888;\">Multiple custom tasks</span><br><br><strong>Remaining now:</strong><br>👉&nbsp;<strong>Only 1 last client</strong> can claim this $250 credit.<br><br>Typical work we’ve been doing under this:<br>• One custom section or widget<br>• A CTA block or highlight strip<br>• Layout refinements on key pages<br>• Member profile or search-result upgrades<br>• Clean-up or optimization of an existing BD page<br>• Minor integration or display logic adjustments<br><br>Reply with what you’d like done — if it fits the remaining slot, we’ll confirm and schedule it immediately.</td></tr><!-- Divider before closing --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Closing / CTA --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you’d like quick guidance based on your niche or what you’re planning for your Brilliant Directories site, just reply — happy to help before the window closes.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 