(52, 'cyberweek2025-email1-option2 -  to pmp customers', '7', 'Cyber Week Deals for Brilliant Directories — Live Now', '<!-- Subject: Cyber Week Deals for Brilliant Directories — Live Now --><p><title>Cyber Week Deals for Brilliant Directories &mdash; Live Now</title></p><!-- Preheader (hidden) --><div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#ffffff;\">Already 50% off + Extra 25%: Cyber Week savings on Brilliant Directories themes, tools and implementations.</div><!-- Main wrapper --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 10px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 4px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><!-- Title --><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 24px; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">Cyber Week Deals for Brilliant Directories &mdash; Live Now</td></tr><!-- Greeting --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; color:#333333;\">Hi %%%First_name%%%,</td></tr><!-- Intro --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Cyber Week is officially open, and we&rsquo;ve unlocked some of our strongest pricing for Brilliant Directories site owners this year.</td></tr><!-- Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Themes section --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">1) Themes &mdash; Up to 50% Off + Extra 25% Off</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 4px 24px; font-size:13px; color:#555555;\">Across all four BD Growth Suite themes:</td