(57, 'Copy of cyberweek2025-email3 - to PMP customers', '10', 'Reminder: Cyber Week Savings for Your BD Website', '<!-- Subject: Reminder: Cyber Week Savings for Your BD Website --><p><title>Reminder: Cyber Week Savings for Your BD Website</title></p><!-- Preheader (hidden) --><div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#ffffff;\">Upto 75% off on BD Development Services ends soon.</div><!-- Main wrapper --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 10px;\"><!-- Content card --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 4px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><!-- Title --><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 24px; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">Reminder: Cyber Week Savings for Your BD Website</td></tr><!-- Greeting --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; color:#333333;\">Hi %%%First_name%%%,</td></tr><!-- Intro --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Quick reminder — Cyber Week is ending soon, and many Brilliant Directories site owners are picking up themes, tools, and using the $250 credit for small custom work. Here’s a short recap before the weekend gets busy:</td></tr><!-- Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 1: Themes --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">1) Themes — Up to 50% Off + Extra 25% Off</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">The four BD Gr