</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you have a small fix or one-off improvement in mind, Cyber Week is a good time to clear it.<br><br>We’re offering a <strong>$250 credit on custom work</strong>, with no minimum project size. Many tasks that fit into roughly&nbsp;<strong>1–8 hours of focused work</strong> can be covered entirely by this credit.<br><br>Common examples:<br>• A small custom layout or section<br>• A new widget or CTA block<br>• Tweaks to member profiles or search results<br>• Display logic adjustments or minor integrations<br>• Clean-up or optimization of an existing BD page or flow<br><br>Just reply with a short description of what you’d like done. We’ll confirm if it fits within the credit and then schedule it.</td></tr><!-- Divider before closing --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Closing / CTA --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 10px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">If you’d like help choosing the right mix of themes, tools or a small custom task for your Brilliant Directories site, just reply to this email — happy to guide.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 24px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Warm regards,<br>BusinessLabs / BD Growth Suite</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Footer --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:11px; color:#777777; line-height:1.5; padding:10px; text-align:center;\">BusinessLabs<br>Brilliant Directories Unit<br>507, Ashoka Bhoopal Chambers<br>Hyderabad, Telangana, India — 500003<br></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>', '20251206052013', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 16, 1, '', '2025-12-06 10:52:44', 1),
(58, 'Copy of cyberweek2025 - email4 last 24hours - to PMP customers', '11', 'Last 24 Hours — BD Cyber Week Ends Tonight', '<!-- Subject: Last 24 Hours — BD Cyber Week Ends Tonight --><p><title>Last 24 Hours — BD Cyber Week Ends Tonight</title></p><!-- Preheader (hidden) --><div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#ffffff;\">Final 24 hours of Cyber Week — last few theme, tool and custom work slots left for Brilliant Directories site owners.</div><!-- Main wrapper --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 10px;\"><!-- Content card --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 4px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><!-- Title --><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 24px; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">Last 24 Hours — BD Cyber Week Ends Tonight</td></tr><!-- Greeting --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; color:#333333;\">Hi %%%First_name%%%,</td></tr><!-- Intro --><tr><td style=\"padding:0 24px 16px 24px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">A quick note —&nbsp;<strong>today is the final 24 hours</strong> of Cyber Week, and the remaining slots are almost gone.<br><br>If you were planning to pick up any themes, tools, or use the $250 custom work credit, this is the last window before everything resets at midnight. Here’s the final update:</td></tr><!-- Divider --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px;\"><hr style=\"border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-style: solid none none; height: 1px;\"></td></tr><!-- Section 1: Themes --><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 24px 4px 24px; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#222222;\">1) Themes — Up