><td style=\"padding:0 24px 24px 24px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">Warm regards,<br>BusinessLabs / BD Growth Suite</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Footer --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; table-layout: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:11px; color:#777777; line-height:1.5; padding:10px; text-align:center;\">BusinessLabs<br>Brilliant Directories Unit<br>507, Ashoka Bhoopal Chambers<br>Hyderabad, Telangana, India — 500003<br></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>', '20251206052355', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 16, 1, '', '2025-12-06 10:54:09', 1),
(59, 'BD Article - Proven Strategies - BusinessLabs', '12', '🚀 Wanna get 5+ Members on your site instantly?', '<p id=\"isPasted\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Hi there 👋,</p><p>One smart move can bring you 5+ members/clients in an hour, what if you have a chance to know 12 such smart moves.</p><p>To help you succeed, our team at BD Growth Suite created a guide with 12 proven strategies to attract your first 100 free members and convert 5-10 into paying clients.</p><p id=\"isPasted\">No ads. No extra tools. Just proven basics that work.</p><p>We&#39;re proud to share that the Brilliant Directories team has published this resource on their official blog for all BD Site owners.</p><p><br></p><p>You can read the full guide here: <a href=\"https://www.brilliantdirectories.com/blog/10-proven-strategies-to-monetize-your-brilliant-directories-website\" style=\"display: inline-block; word-break: keep-all;\">https://www.brilliantdirectories.com/blog/10-proven-strategies-to-monetize-your-brilliant-directories-website</a></p><p><br></p><p>If you have questions or want to discuss how these strategies fit your site, feel free to reach out anytime.</p><p><br></p><p>Warm regards,<br>Praneetha.</p>', '20260212063327', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 16, 0, '', '2026-02-12 12:11:06', 1),
(61, 'theme_order_received_client', '', 'We\'ve received your order! Next steps inside.', '<p>Hi %%%full_name%%%,</p><p>Thank you for choosing our themes to build your perfect site! We have successfully received your request.</p><p>Our team is currently reviewing your selections and setting up your workspace. Within the next&nbsp; 1&ndash;3 business day, our team will send you a secure link to your official invoice.</p><p>%%%order_summary_html%%%</p><p>If you have any immediate questions, please feel free to email us at support@bdgrowthsuite.com or contact us on WhatsApp at&nbsp;+91 77992 85123<br><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666;\">Thank you,<br>Your BD Growth Suite Team.</p><hr style=\"height: 1px; border-width: 1px 0px 0px;\"><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">BD Growth Suite is a product of&nbsp;<strong>BusinessLabs with ~500+ BD site Launches</strong><br>507, Ashoka Bhoopal Chambers, Hyderabad, Telangana, India &ndash; 500003<br><br>&copy; 2026 BusinessLabs. All rights reserved.<br>This is a transactional email related to your %%%tool_product_type%%% purchase.</p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666;\">Need help? Email us at: support@bdgrowthsuite.com</p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2026-04-11 09:01:24', 1),
(62, 'theme_order_manual_admin', '', 'ACTION REQUIRED: Manual Invoice Needed for %%%full_name%%%', '<p>Hello Team,</p><p>A new theme order has been submitted, but the automated PMP invoice API did not trigger successfully. <strong>You must generate an invoice for this client manually and email it to them.</strong></p><p><strong>Client Details:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> %%%full_name%%%</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> %%%user_email%%%</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> %%%phone_number%%%</li></ul><p>%%%order_summary_html%%%</p><p>Please log into the billing portal, generate the invoice matching the items above, and send the secure payment link to the client.</p>', '', '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '2026-04-11 07:32:24', 1),
